url":"https://api.github.com/users/webmozart/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/webmozart/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/webmozart/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/webmozart/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/webmozart/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/webmozart/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/webmozart/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/webmozart/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"event":"closed","commit_id":null,"commit_url":null,"created_at":"2014-04-08T09:53:42Z","state_reason":null,"performed_via_github_app":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/symfony/symfony/issues/comments/49305235","html_url":"https://github.com/symfony/symfony/issues/10409#issuecomment-49305235","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/symfony/symfony/issues/10409","id":49305235,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDQ5MzA1MjM1","user":{"login":"gquemener","id":668604,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY2ODYwNA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/668604?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gquemener","html_url":"https://github.com/gquemener","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gquemener/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gquemener/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gquemener/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gquemener/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gquemener/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gquemener/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gquemener/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gquemener/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gquemener/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2014-07-17T13:21:24Z","updated_at":"2014-07-17T13:22:49Z","body":"I don't know if this is normal, but when the $choices is an array of objects it will try to serialize all the objects instead of serializing the final choices (I mean the one containing the <option> names and labels).\n\nAppart from causing a performance impact (I guess serializing a 1-dimension array is faster than serializing an array of objects), it can cause really hard error to debug (depending on the level of recursivity reached by the serialize method).\nI'm facing this case today on https://github.com/akeneo/pim (I've more than 200 embedded exceptions that say that somewhere serialize() returned something different than null or string).\n\nThe quickfix I've found is to provide directly an array containing only the labels and options' name, instead of an array of objects.\n\nSo I'm wondering if, somehow, this hash could be calculated against the final 1-dimension array rather than on the provided $choices array?\n\nEDIT: Here's the related PR on akeneo: https://github.com/akeneo/pim-community-dev/pull/1261\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/symfony/symfony/issues/comments/49305235/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"gquemener","id":668604,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY2ODYwNA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/668604?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gquemener","html_url":"https://github.com/gquemener","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gquemener/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gquemener/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gquemener/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gquemener/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gquemener/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gquemener/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gquemener/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gquemener/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gquemener/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/symfony/symfony/issues/comments/49306350","html_url":"https://github.com/symfony/symfony/issues/10409#issuecomment-49306350","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/symfony/symfony/issues/10409","id":49306350,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDQ5MzA2MzUw","user":{"login":"gquemener","id":668604,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY2ODYwNA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/668604?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gquemener","html_url":"https://github.com/gquemener","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gquemener/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gquemener/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gquemener/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gquemener/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gquemener/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gquemener/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gquemener/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gquemener/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gquemener/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2014-07-17T13:30:50Z","updated_at":"2014-07-17T13:30:50Z","body":"Oh and wait, I've more!\n\nImagine that I've injected the container in all my choices, does it mean it will try to serialize my whole container for each options??\n\nI know it probably also mean that I'm a poor dev, but I'm being curious here :)\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.